---
import "../styles/global.css";
import Baselayout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Socials from "../components/Social.astro";
---

<Baselayout>
  <section class="animate-fade-up flex flex-col gap-8 text-zinc-300">
    <section class="flex flex-col gap-6 text-zinc-300">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h1 class="text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-zinc-100">
          Parthiv Saikia
        </h1>

        <p class="text-[16px] leading-8">Crafting infra tools with golang.</p>
      </div>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-[16px] leading-8">
        <p>
          Most of my interests orbit around Linux, Kubernetes, Docker, GPUs.
          Currently building
          <a
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            href="https://github.com/parthivsaikia/enmasec"
            class="underline decoration-1 underline-offset-4 decoration-zinc-600 hover:decoration-zinc-300 transition-colors duration-200"
          >
            Enmasec
            <span class="text-sm opacity-70">↗</span>
          </a>, a local-first TUI password manager.
        </p>

        <p>
          I enjoy tools that feel fast, and have minimalistic UI. Lately I’ve
          been exploring kubernetes controllers, GPU and distributed systems.
          You can find more about the tools, setups, and software I currently
          use on the
          <a
            href="/uses"
            class="underline decoration-1 underline-offset-4 decoration-zinc-600 hover:decoration-zinc-300 transition-colors duration-200"
          >
            uses
          </a>
          page.
        </p>

        <p>
          Outside of coding, I read fiction books, watch anime. I also keep a
          small
          <a
            href="/now"
            class="underline decoration-1 underline-offset-4 decoration-zinc-600 hover:decoration-zinc-300 transition-colors duration-200"
          >
            now
          </a>
          page for things I’m currently doing, learning, watching, and building.
        </p>
      </section>
    </section>

    <section class="flex flex-col gap-3 pt-2 text-zinc-300">
      <p class="text-sm">Find me on</p>
      <Socials />
    </section>
  </section>
</Baselayout>
